# Project note update

After substantive projectome analysis or overview changes, merge a new entry at the top of `docs/project_note.md`. Do not wipe older sections.

- Match the existing heading style in that file: dated heading, agent, what changed, evidence links, limits.
- Record decisions, paths, counts, and what was not accepted.
- Do not invent results. If a file was not written, do not claim it.
- Keep the note in English.

```markdown
## 2026-10-12 | Agent Cursor | Short title of what changed
```
